# Privacy Policy

**Effective Date:** July 28, 2026

Thank you for using Chess Board.

This Privacy Policy explains how the App handles information.

## Information We Collect

The App does not collect, store, or sell personal information.

The App only uses the information provided by Reddit that is necessary to display chess games within Reddit. The App does not create user profiles or maintain a separate database of personal information.

## Cookies and Tracking

The App does not use cookies or other tracking technologies.

## Third-Party Services

The App operates on Reddit and may receive limited information from Reddit as necessary to function. Your use of Reddit is governed by Reddit's own Privacy Policy and Terms of Service.

## Data Sharing

The App does not sell, rent, or share your personal information with third parties.

## Data Security

Because the App does not store personal information, no personal data is retained by the App.

## Children's Privacy

The App is not directed toward children under the age required by applicable law to use Reddit. The App does not knowingly collect personal information from children.

## Changes to This Privacy Policy

We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted with an updated Effective Date.

